        "t": 700.7601207999999,
        "r": 564.29854,
        "b": 663.7564183999998
      },
      "content": "Wipe the air conditioner by using a soft and dry cloth.For serious stains,use a neutral detergent diluted with water.Wring the water out of the cloth before wiping.then wipe off the detergent completely."
    },
    {
