        "t": 607.1057108,
        "r": 559.7819686399995,
        "b": 592.0179622399999
      },
      "content": "Hot water over 40 O C(104 O F) may cause discoloring or deformation."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1787",
