      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.7605,
        "t": 310.56674399999997,
        "r": 559.9090151999999,
        "b": 262.02216
      },
      "content": "The white side of the photocatalyst air purifying filter face outside,and the black side face the unit. The green side of the bacteria-killing medium air and the white side face the unit. purifying filter face outside,"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1800",
      "reading_order": 2355,
      "section": "ATTENTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 303.8265,
        "t": 251.4797532,
        "r": 405.2691426999999,
        "b": 233.17551100000003
      },
      "content": "5.Close the Inlet Grille Close the Grille surely"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1801",
      "reading_order": 2356,
      "section": "NOTE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 302.4089,
        "t": 217.78763960000003,
        "r": 340.49784194000006,
        "b": 206.09864900000002
      },
      "content": "NOTE:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1802",
      "reading_order": 2357,
      "section": "NOTE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 308.149,
        "t": 204.53051519999997,
        "r": 562.8545487999996,
        "b": 185.86119680000002
      },
      "content": "The photocatalyst air purifying filter will be solarized in fixed time. In normal family, it will be solarized every 6 months."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1803",
      "reading_order": 2358,
      "section": "NOTE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 306.9454,
        "t": 178.23843120000004,
        "r": 561.0893567999997,
        "b": 120.16202859999999
      },
      "content": "The bacteria-killing medium air purifying filter will be used for a long time,no need for replacement. But in the period of using them ,you should remove the dust frequently by using vacuum cleaner or flaping them lightly,otherwise , its performance will be affected."
    },
